#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is on quantum error correction, with a focus on foundational concepts. \n"
"It begins with an explanation of what quantum error correcting codes are and how they work. \n"
"It then moves on to the discretization of errors phenomenon, the stabilizer formalism for \n"
"describing quantum error correcting codes, Calderbank–Shor–Steane (CSS) codes, and several \n"
"key examples of quantum error correcting codes, including the toric code and surface codes. \n"
"The course also discusses fault-tolerant quantum computation, in which quantum computations \n"
"are performed on error-corrected quantum information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay tungkol sa quantum error correction, na may pokus sa mga pangunahing konsepto.\n"
"Nagsisimula ito sa paliwanag kung ano ang mga quantum error correcting code at kung paano ito gumagana.\n"
"Pagkatapos ay tinatalakay ang discretization of errors phenomenon, ang stabilizer formalism para sa\n"
"paglarawan ng mga quantum error correcting code, Calderbank–Shor–Steane (CSS) codes, at ilang\n"
"mahahalagang halimbawa ng quantum error correcting codes, kasama na ang toric code at surface codes.\n"
"Tinatalakay din ng kurso ang fault-tolerant quantum computation, kung saan isinasagawa ang mga quantum computation\n"
"sa error-corrected na quantum information.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is intended for students, professionals, and hobbyists in fields such as computer science, physics, \n"
"engineering, and mathematics who are eager to gain knowledge on the theoretical foundations of quantum information \n"
"and computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay para sa mga estudyante, propesyonal, at mahilig sa mga larangang tulad ng computer science, pisika,\n"
"engineering, at matematika na sabik na makakuha ng kaalaman sa teoretikal na pundasyon ng quantum information\n"
"at computation.\n"

